  "title": "ISic000490. I.Sicily inscription 000490",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Lucio\"><span data-text=\"Lucio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">L(ucio)</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Acilio\"><span data-text=\"Acilio\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Acilius\">Acilio</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Luci\"><span data-text=\"Luci\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">L(uci)</span></span>  <span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"filius\">f(ilio)</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Rufo\"><span data-text=\"Rufo\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">Rufo</span></span>  <span data-text=\"II\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"II\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">I</span>[<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">I</span>]</span>  <span data-text=\"viro\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"vir\">[viro]</span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"co\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">co</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. c. 8.</span>] <span data-text=\"ter\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">ter</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Lucio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">Lucio</span>  <span data-text=\"Acilio\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Acilius\">Acilio</span>  <span data-text=\"Luci\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">Luci</span>  <span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"filius\">filio</span>  <span data-text=\"Rufo\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">Rufo</span>  <span data-text=\"II\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"II\">II</span>  <span data-text=\"viro\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"vir\">viro</span>  <span data-text=\"co\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">co</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">. c. 8.</span>] <span data-text=\"ter\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">ter</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Lucio\"><span data-text=\"Lucio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">L</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Acilio\"><span data-text=\"Acilio\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Acilius\">ACILIO</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Luci\"><span data-text=\"Luci\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">L</span></span><span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"filius\">F</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Rufo\"><span data-text=\"Rufo\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">RUFO</span></span><span data-text=\"II\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"II\"><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">I</span>[.</span><span data-text=\"viro\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"vir\">....]</span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"co\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">CO</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">········</span>]<span data-text=\"ter\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">TER</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Lucio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">LUCIO</span><span data-text=\"Acilio\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Acilius\">ACILIO</span><span data-text=\"Luci\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">LUCI</span><span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"filius\">FILIO</span><span data-text=\"Rufo\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">RUFO</span><span data-text=\"II\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"II\">II</span><span data-text=\"viro\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"vir\">VIRO</span><span data-text=\"co\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">CO</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">········</span>]<span data-text=\"ter\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"NOLEMMA\">TER</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000490_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic000490_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000490.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic000490-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of CIL</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 3\">line.3: <span>co[lonia] T(h)er[mitanorum], Mommsen (after Huelsen)</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>(Set up for) Lucius Acilius Rufus, son of Lucius, duumvir [...]</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Quite possibly erected by the colonia Thermitanorum. A man of the same name is named as quaestor Siciliae in CIL 10.7344 = ILTermini no.8 = ILPalermo no.53 = <a href=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000052\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000052</a></p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li> Gualtherus 1624 231 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] 127 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\" target=\"_blank\">7210</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
